&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our compensation reflects the cost of living across several US geographic markets. At Coupang, your base pay is one part of your total compensation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
