&lt;li&gt;Experience with SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and with a team in a fast-paced and high-volume environment with emphasis on accuracy and timeliness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational and time management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
