&lt;h2&gt;AnyLive is an AI-powered Live Commerce Platform designed to revolutionize online shopping by providing 24/7 AI-driven live streaming that enhances engagement, drives conversions, and maximizes e-commerce sales.&lt;br&gt;The Senior Executive, AI Live Streaming Operations will ensure seamless, professional, and engaging live broadcasts using strong technical expertise in live streaming setup and management, keen monitoring skills, and excellent interpersonal abilities. This role is crucial for audience engagement and primarily utilizes OBS for technical operations.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;AnyMind Group is an end-to-end commerce enablement company that provides both point-based solutions and a comprehensive, inter-connected suite of products to drive next-generation commerce. The company offers tools to businesses, publishers and influencers - from cloud manufacturing and e-commerce enablement, to marketing, logistics, media monetization and creator monetization. We&#39;re on a mission to make every business borderless by removing borders between businesses and customers, online and offline, and between industries, data silos, geographical boundaries and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI Live Production Operation (85%)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute comprehensive pre-stream preparations, including equipment setup, software configuration (&lt;strong&gt;primarily OBS with elements like stickers, packshots, overlays, and scenes&lt;/strong&gt;), studio environment setup, and detailed attention to product placement and host positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct thorough technical checks. Handle all live stream technical operations using OBS, managing scene transitions, graphic overlays, and multimedia playback, ensuring the stream runs smoothly according to schedule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously monitor live stream quality (audio-visual, stability) and audience engagement, proactively troubleshooting any technical issues in real-time to ensure a smooth broadcast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage live chat moderation and audience interaction tools to foster engagement, which includes monitoring and responding to audience comments/questions and potentially highlighting viewer input for the host.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the recording, archiving, and perform basic editing of live stream content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct script writing, TTS generation, visual coordination, and be responsible for overall content quality checks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform other ad hoc tasks related to live streaming or team support as directed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Live Streaming Strategy (15%)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with content creators, hosts, and marketing teams on planning, including pre-planned rundowns or scripts for the live stream.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze live stream performance data to&lt;strong&gt; generate reports, identify areas for improvement, and provide optimization recommendations.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay updated with the latest streaming technologies, platforms, and industry best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure adherence to the terms of service and community guidelines of the specific live streaming platform being used.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven 2-3 years of experience in a live streaming role with in-depth knowledge of streaming hardware (cameras, audio, lighting, encoders), software (e.g., OBS, vMix), and various platforms (e.g., YouTube Live, Facebook Live, Twitch).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of video/audio encoding, streaming protocols (RTMP, HLS), network configurations, and excellent real-time troubleshooting skills for live events.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable ability to monitor live stream analytics, interpret data, and implement strategies for performance optimization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills, with a proven ability to confidently engage and support hosts, talent, and team members.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and collaboratively in a fast-paced, dynamic environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to work irregular hours, including evenings and weekends, as dictated by live event schedules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love It&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;A&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(53, 152, 219);&quot;&gt;d&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(132, 63, 161);&quot;&gt;v&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(185, 106, 217);&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(186, 55, 42);&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(230, 126, 35);&quot;&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(241, 196, 15);&quot;&gt;d&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(22, 145, 121);&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(45, 194, 107);&quot;&gt;I&lt;/span&gt; Tools For All Positions!!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative office at Emporium (located at BTS Phrom Phong)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hard, play harder office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance Review ( 2 times per year )&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance Bonus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual Paid Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compassionate Leave&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social Security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discount for Fitness Gym at EmQuartier&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly, Quarterly, Annual MVP Awards (prizes up to 8,000USD)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in professional and dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good chance to explore new trends in a digital market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to learn most advanced advertising technology platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Thailand Office&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/dk-ECuPuHFw&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

