&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A current&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;New Jersey&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Physical Therapist License.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of one year of recent work experience as a Physical Therapist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OASIS experience required and HCHB strongly preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
